story += [fig('rally-rule-300mm',450),p('Folding rule and calibration bar','H2AC'),p('Three 100 mm-interval links form a nominal 0–300 mm rule. Recessed pivot seats let the separate printed pins and caps sit within the link thickness. The links do not positively lock straight. Use a straightedge and a reliable external measure to check scale and joint registration after printing.'),p('The separate 100 mm bar is a shrinkage/check coupon, not a certified measuring instrument. The folding rule is not approved for legal catch sizing.'),p('The next release must prove','H2AC'),p('Physical fit and retention; intended loads and fatigue; the exact material and print process; any electrical/thermal or product-safety duties; commercial rights; final supplier pricing, assembly and NZ delivery; and an end-to-end order with its immutable design/file revision.'),p('Store integration','H2AC'),p('Keep the approved Assembl Living storefront. Add a Dayrally area and use the exact GLB/STEP/STL files and file hashes in this package. Photo, room choice, name, accessories, geometry revision and final order need one saved configuration. The current package does not connect a supplier or grant manufacturing approval.'),p('No fonts, credentials, tokens or supplier secrets are included. No job has been handed to another GPT workspace through this file generation.','SmallAC')]
